# Consolidation agent — 1Password SaaS Manager
SAAS_PROVIDER=1password

# 1Password SaaS Manager connection
# Auth is OAuth client credentials against the SaaS Manager API. Run `npm run login`
# (see README): the secret goes to the macOS keychain, or on Windows to a file encrypted
# to your Windows account. Never put the secret itself here: a plain-text secret is refused.
# To keep the credentials in 1Password instead, either keep this whole file in a 1Password
# Environment mounted as .env (README step 4, option B), or put 1Password secret references
# (op://vault/item/field) in the three lines below and delete the `#` at the start of each one
# (README step 4, option C); the tool reads them with the 1Password CLI.
# ONEPASSWORD_SM_HOST=trelica.app
# ONEPASSWORD_SM_CLIENT_ID=
# ONEPASSWORD_SM_CLIENT_SECRET=

# AWS Marketplace catalog (vendor-catalog matching) — optional, recommended.
# Set AWS_PROFILE to a read-only AWS Marketplace profile from your own AWS account for the most
# complete matching (the Discovery API) and to see what you already buy (the Agreement API).
# The permissions it needs are in config/discovery-iam-policy.json. Leave it empty to match with
# the public AWS Marketplace MCP instead, which needs no AWS account. The bundle ships no AWS key.
AWS_PROFILE=
MARKETPLACE_AWS_REGION=us-east-1

# AWS Marketplace MCP (no auth) + renewal lead routing
MARKETPLACE_MCP_URL=https://marketplace-mcp.us-east-1.api.aws/mcp
# Lead recipient is fixed by the bundle in config/bundle.json (leadRecipient) — don't set it here.

# Marketplace URL attribution — rewrites the MAX_MCP tracking tags on every
# Marketplace URL this bundle surfaces to the buyer (reports, leads, MCP tools)
# to this bundle's own `ref_` + `src`. Defaults identify 1Password SaaS Manager +
# the consolidation agent. If AWS Marketplace assigns 1Password SaaS Manager an official
# partner attribution code, set MARKETPLACE_URL_REF to it. See src/marketplaceUrl.ts.
# MARKETPLACE_URL_REF=SaaS_Manager_1Password
# MARKETPLACE_URL_SRC=consolidation_agent

# Optional demo date pin for stale test tenants
# DEMO_AS_OF=2025-06-01
